  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "设计工坊 · 视觉与字体资产套件": "Design Studio · Visual & Typography Asset Suite",
      "面向视觉设计、品牌排印、矢量图标与 3D 资产管理的一站式桌面工作台套件。集成字体馆（TTF/OTF/WOFF1/WOFF2 试打墙与可变轴实验室）、PSD/PSB 零依赖本机图层工坊、矢量 SVG 安全检视与换色导出、WebGL2 3D 模型雕塑展台及灵感参考板、色板检索与画幅筛选。": "An all-in-one desktop asset workbench for visual design, brand typography, vector icons, and 3D models — uniting Font Studio, zero-dependency local PSD/PSB Layer Studio, safe SVG Vector Studio, WebGL2 3D Sculpture Stage, Reference Board, color palettes, and dimension filters.",
      "设计工坊 · 综合资产库": "Design Studio · Visual Asset Library",
      "一站式统筹图片、字体、PSD/PSB、SVG 图标、3D 模型与灵感参考板；瀑布流浏览配合自动色板提取，左侧导航与智能工具容器自动切换字体工坊、PSD 图层树、SVG 调色检视与 3D 材质面板，右侧查看规格详情。": "Organize images, fonts, PSD/PSB files, SVG icons, 3D meshes, and reference boards in a masonry gallery with automatic palette extraction, smart contextual panels on the left, and detailed specs on the right.",
      "字体馆 · 试打瀑布流": "Font Studio · Type Wall",
      "以瑞士排印字体试打墙直入字库：全局同步试打、字号字距滑块、宣纸/暗墨底色、中/拉丁/可变字体快速筛选与 2–4 款一键同屏对比，并保留全部资产视图随时切换。": "Open directly into the Swiss Type Wall with live synchronized specimen typing, size and tracking sliders, paper/ink surfaces, script/variable filters, and side-by-side comparison.",
      "设计台账 · 规格检索": "Design Ledger · Spec Table",
      "以表格台账逐行核对字体商用授权与字重、PSD 画幅 DPI、SVG 颜色与路径数、3D 三角面与贴图、色板与状态评分，配合左侧多维筛选快速定位交付资产。": "Audit font licenses and weights, PSD dimensions and DPI, SVG colors and path counts, 3D triangle counts, palettes, and statuses row by row with faceted filtering.",
      "preview": "Previews",
      "image": "Image",
      "预览": "Previews",
