      "设计工坊": "Design Studio",
      "面向品牌与视觉设计的资产工作台：字体试打墙与可变轴、PSD/PSB 图层审稿、SVG 图标调色、3D 模型展台与灵感参考板。": "Visual design asset desk featuring a live type specimen wall, local PSD/PSB layer inspection, safe SVG recoloring, WebGL2 3D turntable, and PureBoard.",
      "综合设计资产库": "Visual Asset Library",
